{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31604","headline":"送唐侍御福建省兄 · 李羣玉","name":"送唐侍御福建省兄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"桂枝攀尽贾家才，霄汉春风棣萼开。\n世掌纶言传大笔，官分鸿序压霜台。\n闽山翠卉迎飞斾，越水清纹散落梅。\n到日池塘春草绿，谢公应梦惠连来。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李羣玉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31604.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31604","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}